OL,3,GNEWSABurst main sparks flood as homes
OL,4,Aleft with no water
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service, which was
OL,7,Fcalled to the area at 05:19 BST and
OL,8,Fworked to isolate electrical supplies
OL,9,Fand channel water into drainage
OL,10,Fsystems, has said about 1,500
OL,11,Fproperties are affected.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
